id: resilience
name: Resilience
prerequisites: Tenacity Score 6+
description: >
  Able to bounce back from damage more easily than most, you are exceptionally
  good at ignoring injuries.
text: >
  Increase your Soak Value by 1(bT).
  Increase the Life Points regained through a Healing Surge by 1d10(T).

---

[passive]
soakValue       += 1(bT);
surge.life.dice += 1d10(T);
